<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '20px 60px', background: '#10141A', fontFamily: "'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif", flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 96, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, color: '#EDF1F5', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>多模型分工，与不依赖模型的证据接地校验</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 7, letterSpacing: 0.3 }}>Three models in sequence — and grounding checked without any model</Text>
      </Box>
      
    </Box>
  </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 500 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, height: 286 }}>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '13px 15px', background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #232C38', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4CB8A6', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>叙事者 / NARRATOR</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 5 }}>gpt-4o</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 3 }}>Renders the commit stream into a decision history</Text>
          <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, paddingTop: 8, borderTop: '1px solid #2C3542' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, lineHeight: 1.6, color: '#A8B2BE' }}>它把两仓库的提交序列各自还原成一条决策史，并为每个转折点标注对应的 commit SHA：openclaw 与 topfo 各识别 2 个转折点，全部通过下方证据接地校验。其输出的标题与叙述见第 08、09 页的实测数字旁。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, lineHeight: 1.45, color: '#6B7684', marginTop: 5 }}>It renders each commit stream into a decision history; every turning point it names must cite a real commit SHA.</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '13px 15px', background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #232C38', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E3A33E', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>假设者 / HYPOTHESIZER</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 5 }}>deepseek-v4-pro</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 3 }}>Infers what an abandoned change was trying to do</Text>
          <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, paddingTop: 8, borderTop: '1px solid #2C3542' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, lineHeight: 1.6, color: '#A8B2BE' }}>topfo 输出 6 条推断，逐条标置信度与依据，全部接地；并归纳出「这批被放弃的改动呈现出典型的「架构升级阵痛」模式」这一模式。openclaw 在窗口内没有检出候选，于是<span style={{ color: '#E3A33E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>直接跳过</span>（skipReason: no_abandoned_attempts）—— 宁可不给结论，也不编一个。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, lineHeight: 1.45, color: '#6B7684', marginTop: 5 }}>On openclaw the layer skipped itself rather than produce an invented narrative.</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '13px 15px', background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #232C38', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4CB8A6', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>审稿人 / APPRAISER</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 5 }}>gemini-2.5-flash</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 3 }}>Reviews both, issues a verdict and a question list</Text>
          <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, paddingTop: 8, borderTop: '1px solid #2C3542' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, lineHeight: 1.6, color: '#A8B2BE' }}>openclaw 裁决：「这份代码的历史非常清晰且高度规范，没有回滚、打转或含糊提交，属于一次目标明确的高效集中修复。」；topfo 裁决：「代码历史整体清晰，虽然经历过架构升级带来的阵痛和62天沉寂，但提交质量极高且无含糊信息，属于目标明确的快速演进项目。」。它并不一味附和 —— 本次对假设者提出 2 条质疑，指出其「仅凭同一个提交里伴随的语法修复就推断国际化方案未定」属于过度推断。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, lineHeight: 1.45, color: '#6B7684', marginTop: 5 }}>The appraiser openly challenged the hypothesizer's over-inference — the critique is part of the output.</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, height: 92, marginTop: 12, padding: '12px 18px', background: '#1D242E', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(76,184,166,0.40)' }}>
        
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>10</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 3 }}>条推断 · 两仓库合计</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 1 }}>claims, both repos</Text>
          </Box>
        
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EDF1F5', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>18</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 3 }}>个 commit SHA 引用</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 1 }}>commit SHA citations</Text>
          </Box>
        
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4CB8A6', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>0</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 3 }}>条编造证据</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 1 }}>fabricated citations</Text>
          </Box>
        
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4CB8A6', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>0</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 3 }}>条无效引用</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 1 }}>invalid citations</Text>
          </Box>
        
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4CB8A6', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC','Songti SC',serif" }}>100%</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 3 }}>证据接地率</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 1 }}>grounding rate</Text>
          </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ height: 98, marginTop: 12, padding: '10px 18px', background: 'rgba(227,163,62,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(227,163,62,0.35)', borderRadius: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#E3A33E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>为什么「编造」可以一次集合运算判定 / Why fabrication is provable, not judged</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, lineHeight: 1.5, color: '#EDF1F5', marginTop: 6 }}>
          模型产出的每条结论必须引用一个 commit SHA，而这份 SHA 清单是程序从 GitHub 真实拉回来的。因此「引用了一个不存在的提交」不需要另一个模型来评判 —— 程序对两个集合做一次差集即可判定。这一步 100% 由代码完成，不经过任何模型。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, lineHeight: 1.45, color: '#8892A0', marginTop: 5 }}>
          Every claim must cite a SHA drawn from the API response; a citation outside that set is provable fabrication, decided by set difference — no model involved.
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 32, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#6B7684', textAlign: 'right' }}>第三方仓库来源 / Third-party source：openclaw/openclaw（TypeScript · 390,102 stars）· GitHub REST API v3 · 采集窗口 2026-09-20T00:07:32Z → 2026-09-20T02:23:19Z（UTC）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#6B7684', textAlign: 'right' }}>第三方仓库来源 / Third-party source：ody-cai/topfo（HTML · 2 stars）· GitHub REST API v3 · 采集窗口 2026-07-09T02:38:58Z → 2026-09-20T01:53:29Z（UTC）</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 36, marginTop: 6, paddingTop: 8, borderTop: '1px solid #232C38', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8892A0' }}>代码考古学 / Code Archaeology · BAYTECH 2026 · AI 应用与工程赛道</Text>
